# requirements.in — dependencies of the lab setup scripts themselves
# AI-GENERATED: Phase 50 Step 50.1 (plan.md)
#
# install.sh installs these into the repo-root .venv before running
# labsetup.py, because labsetup.py and preflight_check.py import
# requests and yaml at load time: on a fresh machine (and on Ubuntu
# 26.04, where the system Python refuses pip installs) they would
# crash before they could install anything.
#
# Per-project dependencies (projects/embedding, speed-reading) stay in
# their own requirements.in and venvs, managed by labsetup.py.
#
# pip-tools is listed so `pip-sync requirements.txt` does not uninstall
# the very tool that runs it.
#
# Regenerate the lock after editing:
#   pip-compile --strip-extras miscellaneous/setup/requirements.in

requests
pyyaml
pip-tools
